Follow the repository's root `AGENTS.md` and `DECISIONS.md` as the canonical rules. Read `STATUS.md` and the relevant design/security docs before editing.

Native iOS = SwiftUI. Native Android = Kotlin + Jetpack Compose Material 3. The 20-screen Figma prototypes are the visual source of truth. Use small testable slices and never claim a demo verdict is a real threat lookup. Do not introduce remote URL fetching, embedded provider secrets or unconsented uploads.
